    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1138">

                <pb facs="0853" n="777" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg777"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17166</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Williams to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consular Agency</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Torreon</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 27, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Since my telegram January 15, midnight, expropriation foreign-owned cotton
                    stopped, due to representations made by representatives German Government and
                    French Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
